# Training curve PNG exports go here.
#
# Recommended files:
#   - reward_curve.png         (avg PRM step rewards over training steps)
#   - kl_coef_vs_step.png      (adaptive KL controller behavior)
#   - clipfrac_vs_step.png     (PPO clip rate — should stay <50%)
#   - prm_vs_kl_dominance.png  (the ratio plot from kl_monitoring.monitor.prm_to_kl_dominance)
#
# Export from W&B with: `wandb.Run.export_panels()` or via the web UI.
